<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><title>Business Requirements Document (BRD) – &lt;Project name&gt;</title>
<style>body{font-family:Calibri,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;line-height:1.45}h1{font-size:22pt;color:#2E3192}h2{font-size:14pt;color:#2E3192;border-bottom:1px solid #ccc}table{border-collapse:collapse}td{border:1px solid #999;padding:4px 10px}</style></head>
<body><h1>Business Requirements Document (BRD) – &lt;Project name&gt;</h1><p>Business language only: the why, the goals and the business needs.</p><table><tr><td>Document owner</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Version / status</td><td>v0.1 · Draft</td></tr><tr><td>Reviewers / approvers</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>Last updated</td><td></td></tr></table>
<h2>1. Document control</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Version, author, reviewers, approvers, sign-off dates.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>2. Executive summary</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>The problem, the proposed solution and expected value in 5–6 lines.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>3. Business objectives</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>SMART objectives, e.g. &#x27;Cut loan approval time from 5 days to 1 day by Q4&#x27;.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>4. Background and current state (AS-IS)</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>How the process works today, pain points, data, process map.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>5. Future state (TO-BE)</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>How it will work after the change, with a process map.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>6. Scope</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>In scope, out of scope, assumptions, constraints.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>7. Stakeholders</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Stakeholder list and RACI (Responsible, Accountable, Consulted, Informed).</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>8. Business requirements</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>BR-IDs with description, priority (MoSCoW), owner and rationale.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>9. KPIs and success criteria</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Baseline, target, how and when measured.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>10. Cost-benefit and ROI</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Costs, benefits, payback period; options considered.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>11. Risks, dependencies and compliance</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Risks with mitigations; RBI/SEBI/IRDAI/DPDP or other rules.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2>12. Approval</h2><p style='color:#666'><i>Sign-off by sponsor and business owners.</i></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style="color:#888;font-size:9pt">Template from SkillNavora · skillnavora.in · Write it faster with the free AI writer: skillnavora.in/prd-writer</p></body></html>